# Dashboard + Realtime Rules

- Dashboard code lives in `src/gold_signal_system/dashboard_static/`.
- Preserve Vanilla HTML/JS/CSS unless migration is explicitly requested.
- Keep REST payloads backward compatible and `/ws/events` handling resilient.
- Show loading, empty, reconnecting, stale-data, blocked, and error states.
- Do not expose credentials, tokens, DSNs, or sensitive account data.
- Check the browser console manually after UI changes.
